                    </span>
                    <span
                      class="block text-secondary text-xs mt-0.5"
                    >
                      Strict OVF 1.0, no vendor extensions, E1000 NIC. Widest compatibility: VirtualBox, Proxmox, oVirt.
                    </span>
                  </span>
                </label>
                <label
                  class="flex items-start p-3 border rounded-md cursor-pointer border-main"
                >
                  <input
